This directory is a dsh (DeepSeek Harness) web-GUI plugin, not a ROS 2 package.
It is version-controlled here so the plugin has a home in this repository, but it must
never be picked up by colcon. Install it with:

  dsh plugin --profile web add ~/.dsh/plugins/dsh-system-monitor

See README.md in this directory for the full install/verify steps.
